  unitName: Granmeria
  unitId: 10613
  unitNumber: 935
  description: A plant in Ishgria decorated with a strange pattern. It consumes other
    living organisms in order to restore its energy, but consuming more than the
    necessary amount makes it go into a frenzy, rendering it unable to control itself.
    Extremely aggressive in nature, it considers any living thing in its surroundings
    to be an enemy, and rushes to attack it. The creatures which fall prey to the
    Granmeria are chopped to bits by its poisonous fangs, and are said to be eaten
    until no trace of them remains.
  summonDesc: So you're a Summoner?<br>Don't bore me if I go with you,<br>otherwise
    I'll go berserk.
  fusionDesc: Is that all you have for me?<br>Hurry up and bring me more.<br>I want
    to feel nourished.
  evoDesc: GRAAAAAAAH...<br>I can feel my body evolving.<br>You should find me more
    sustenance.
  element: 1
  rarity: 3
